			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 750180301,
					"content": "\"Grrr!\"\\nSepertinya si Qucusaurus sadar dirinya bukan lawan seimbang, dan segera pergi sambil menggeram ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NEED_CLICK_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180302
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750180302,
					"content": "WAH! Te-Terbangnya ngebut amat! Langsung enggak kelihatan dalam sekejap.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180303,
						750180305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180303,
					"content": "Paimon, kejar!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180304
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750180304,
					"content": "La-Lah?! Paimon? NGEJAR?!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180307,
					"content": "Hmm, terbangnya bisa cepat gitu, artinya kondisinya sudah jauh lebih baik. Berikutnya ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180308,
					"content": "Eh, kenapa si Qucusaurus tadi ngambek sampai segitunya?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180309,
					"content": "Hmm, Paimon tahu! Kamu maling makanannya! Awas, jangan anggap remeh dendam karena makanan!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180310,
					"content": "Makanan? Ah, iya. Aku memang makan dikit, tapi si Kururuk bukan tipe yang ngambek karena hal sepele gitu.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180311,
					"content": "\"Kururuk\"? Lah, ada namanya? Tapi kok dia galak betul ya ... kamu nyaris kena tampol tadi.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180312,
					"content": "Yah, mau gimana lagi ... pengobatannya sih.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180313,
					"content": "Wah, zaman sekarang digebukin bisa dijual sebagai teknik pengobatan?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180314
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750180314,
					"content": "Nguk! Nguk nguk!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180315,
					"content": "#HAH? Itu kamu pemahaman dari mana lagi sih?! Jangan bercanda aneh-aneh, nanti si {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]} salah paham!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180316,
					"content": "Nguk? Fuwaaa?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180317,
					"content": "Haha, kalau ada terapi \"digebukin\", aku juga mau coba dong. Sayangnya Saurian beda aturan sama manusia. Dikasih tahu cara pengobatan terampuh juga belum tentu mereka paham.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180318,
					"content": "Ah, kenalkan dulu. Namaku Mazkal, biasa mengurus Saurian sakit atau cedera di wilayah sini. Yah, bukan mau nyombong sih, tapi obatku mujarab, yang sudah coba umumnya puas.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180319,
					"content": "Hmm. Rekanmu kelihatannya sehat, tidak perlu diobati apa-apa.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180320,
					"content": "Nguk! Nguk nguk!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180321,
					"content": "Ah, kamu dokter Saurian toh! Hmm, kalau ngelihat peristiwa si Kururuk tadi, kayaknya kerjanya enggak gampang ya ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180322,
					"content": "Oh, biasa saja kok sebenarnya. Kururuk saja yang agak lain, dia lagi ada krisis kepercayaan sama manusia. Makanya menolak diobati.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180323,
					"content": "Ck, coba kalau aku ini Saurian. Dari pengamatan sih dia akur-akur saja sama Saurian lainnya. Mungkin dia bakal mau makan obat kalau disuruh sama Saurian.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180324
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180324,
					"content": "Nguk?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180325,
					"content": "Hmm, kalau gitu sih kayaknya kami bisa bantu nih!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180326,
					"content": "Hah? Jangan-jangan kalian ... jelmaan Saurian?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180327,
					"content": "Hebat juga ngehalunya. Ck ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180328
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180328,
					"content": "#Yah, pokoknya kami bisa bantu! Soalnya ... si {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}! Dia nih kecil-kecil cabe rawit, pintar banget!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180329
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180329,
					"content": "Wah? Dia secerdas itu?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180330,
						750180332
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180330,
					"content": "Yah, dia cerdas kan milih teman.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180331
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 750180331,
					"content": "Uh, okeee ... tapi bukan itu intinya woi!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180333
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180333,
					"content": "#Ya! Intinya, urusan ini serahin saja sama si {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}! Dijamin beres!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180334
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180334,
					"content": "Fuwaaa! Nguk!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180335
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180335,
					"content": "#Kalau gitu, terima kasih banyak ya, {REALNAME[ID(2)|SHOWHOST(true)]}. Sekalian mewakilkan si Kururuk bilang terima kasih!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180336
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180336,
					"content": "Aku cemas kalau dia bertingkah terus, takut luka lamanya makin parah dan jadi luka baru ... jadi, terima kasih banyak!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180337
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180337,
					"content": "Aku sudah sedia dua ramuan obat buat dia. Khasiat penenang dan soal rasanya di mulut juga sudah aku racik sebagus mungkin, tapi ya ....",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						750180338
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Mazkal"
				},
				{
					"id": 750180338,
					"content": "Jadi ada dua obat, yang lebih ampuh rasanya agak najis, sedangkan yang Saurian biasa doyan khasiatnya agak kurang.",
